<section class="rb-opening">
  <div class="rb-opening-inner">
    <p class="rb-opening-lead">
      Three days in the quiet of the Ardennes, gathered around sound, voice, and one another.
    </p>
    <p class="rb-opening-body">
      This is a retreat to be met — as and for who you already are — by
      people willing to do the same. To sound together. To sit in circle.
      To rest. To remember what the body already knows:
      <em>that belonging is not something we earn. It is something we return to.</em>
    </p>
    <p class="rb-opening-body">
      Lesanne and Jacob hold a slow, spacious room — equal parts
